": "Medical Insurance Obligation", "authorityName": "Dubai Multi Commodities Centre", "isRequired": true, "severity": "critical", "article": null, "section": "DMCC-HR-02", "source": null, "rulesetName": "DMCC Employment Regulations"}'::jsonb, '2026-03-04T19:09:32.857Z'::timestamptz, 'text-embedding-3-small');
